          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3565001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这是一个司空见惯的，晴朗的午后。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3565002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我回来啦！优纪！\n今天有发生什么有趣的事情吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3565003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你看起来好熟悉……我认识你吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3565004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你知道……「|101|」是谁吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3565005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一提及这个名字，这里总会有温暖的感觉，可是到底是谁呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
